<view class="page history-page"><view class="chapter-heading"><text class="chapter-seal">留记</text><view><text class="eyebrow">仅当前会话可见</text><text class="page-title">AI 问答记录</text></view></view><text class="session-note">模拟记录，未持久化</text><text class="disclaimer">内容仅供出行参考，请以景区、交通等官方公告为准</text><view wx:if="{{records.length}}" class="history-list"><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="requestId" class="history-item"><text class="history-title">{{item.title}}</text><message-bubble role="assistant" content="{{item.answer}}" mode="mock" label="模拟回答，仅用于交互测试" /><source-card facts="{{item.localFacts}}" references="{{item.references}}" /></view></view><view wx:else class="empty-card card"><text class="empty-title">暂时没有模拟记录</text><text class="note">在 AI 旅游助手中完成一次问答或行程定制后，会在当前会话中显示在这里。</text></view></view>
